Package: shredder
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: secure-delete Tracker add-on for V\OS
 Shredder adds a right-click Tracker action that overwrites the
 selected files repeatedly (up to 24 passes) before deleting them. The
 overwrite is plain data rewriting: on a journalled filesystem it is
 best-effort, since the filesystem and the device may still keep old
 blocks.
